== Trivia ==
*'''Holy Ice''' is primarily used to protect against attacks from the {{MobSprite|Riftstalker Bloodfiend}} slayer boss.
**In vampire folklore [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holy_water#Unofficial_uses/ Holy Water] was believed to ward off or act as a weapon against mythical evil creatures, such as [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vampire#/ vampires].<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20140314220256/http://www.scribd.com/doc/29531529/A-DICTIONARY-OF-SUPERSTITIONS-mytholog%C4%B1es</ref>
*'''Holy Ice''' is the [[Rift]] equivalent of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holy_water_in_Christianity#/ Holy Water]. 
**[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holy_water_in_Christianity#/ Holy Water] is water that has been sanctified by a priest for the purpose of baptism, for the blessing of persons, and as a means of repelling evil.<ref>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Holy_water_in_Christianity#cite_note-1</ref> 
***The ability name {{AN|Splash Yo Face}} is related to the use of Holy Water in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baptism#/ Baptisms], which are performed by sprinkling or pouring water on the head.<ref>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baptism#cite_note-Hale2012-5</ref> 

